<p id="S5.F3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><a href="#S5.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 5.1.1 Results ‣ 5.1 Pre-training with 8-bit Muon ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Effective Quantization of Muon Optimizer States" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></p></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Validation loss for GPT XS/Small/Medium/XL across six optimizers. X-axis: token count (billions). 8-bit Muon optimizers are competitive with Muon, closely matching its performance.</figcaption>
</figure>
